      "status": "approve",
      "reasoning": "TOGO M2716 explicitly places the six-water double salt in the trace-elements table; source formula preserves one iron, two ammonium, two sulfate and six waters, consistent with CHEBI:76181. This supports the exact spelling alias only, not the entire trace stock or flattened receiving-medium amount.",
